{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXHIBITION MODE (up to 2 Players)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a  single game of hockey. (Player vs CPU, Player vs Player, or CPU vs CPU)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TOURNAMENT MODE (up to 2 Players)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against multiple rounds of teams in a tournament bracket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring various preset brackets based on historic tournaments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRACTICE MODE (1 Player)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice the game\u2019s controls with configurable scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD CHAMPION (1 Player)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against a sequence of teams with increasing difficulty, beat them all without a loss to become the undisputed champion team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONLINE (2 Player, 1 Local)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a game of hockey against a human player over the internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURING</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Teams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable rules for Icing, Fighting, Overtime, and Penalties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable Camera Settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shootouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Unlockable Teams, Rinks, and Gameplay Modifiers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tournament Amateur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552680/77a55efd3da46108a98e626a0ef8e885712b3076.jpg"},{"name":"Tournament Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st